<title>CHINA: Hangzhou-Ningbo freeway opens to traffic.</title>
<headline>Hangzhou-Ningbo freeway opens to traffic.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-12-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A new freeway linking the east China coastal city of Ningbo with Hangzhou in the west opened to traffic on Friday, the Liberation Daily said on Saturday.</p>
<p>The 145 km-long road is an important part of the growing highway network in the Yangtze Delta area with Shanghai at its centre, the newspaper said.</p>
</text>
